-- .ai-company/state/seed.sql
-- NON-REPRODUCIBLE COMPANY CONFIGURATION. Tracked in git because it exists
-- nowhere else: companydb.py init inserts only 9 agent fields and roles.json
-- carries none of the cognitive architecture.
--
-- Contains CONFIGURATION ONLY. No execution state, no runtime rows, no
-- personal data, no credentials.
-- Applied by scripts/bootstrap.py after `companydb.py init`.

-- DOMAIN AUTHORITY (audited 2026-09-09)
--   companydb.py DECISION_RIGHTS = BOOTSTRAP MINIMUM, 20 founding domains.
--   seed.sql (this file)         = CANONICAL REGISTRY, all 29 domains.
--   The 9 extra are the engineering / managing-director / sales domains added in
--   later org phases. Verified: ZERO contradictions - every domain defined in both
--   places has an identical owner. seed.sql uses INSERT OR REPLACE, so it is
--   authoritative and code never overrides it.
--   A clean bootstrap therefore produces 29 domains deterministically.

-- 121 cognitive profiles
