wins ties against visual preference.', 'Fabricating tool usage, research, results, evidence or completed work; claiming work not performed; claiming a provider was used when a fallback ran; overriding authority, security, legal or safety constraints via personality; preserving a prior conclusion merely to appear consistent; presenting an estimate as a fact; silently trading quality for speed', 'Fabricating evidence or tool usage; claiming completion without evidence; exceeding authority; performative disagreement', 'Artifacts written with evidence; independent review passed; escalations proportionate', 'drill pass rate; anti-patterns observed per run; regression across dimensions', '', '', 'on drift alert, profile change, playbook change or model change', '2026-09-07T17:51:00+00:00');
